Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.83,0:00:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a day!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.01,0:00:07.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gorgeous!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.51,0:00:09.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as we can stay on this heading,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.15,0:00:11.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we should reach the marine\Nbase in no time at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.61,0:00:13.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, Kobe, you're great out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.55,0:00:16.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean we're actually gonna reach\Nthe place we originally set out for?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.85,0:00:18.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.11,0:00:20.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just using the skills\Nthat every sailor should have.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.25,0:00:22.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, there's really\Nnothing to be so giggly about,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.93,0:00:27.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because at the marine base, they're\Nholding the great pirate hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.37,0:00:30.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roronoa Zoro
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.39,0:00:37.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the man who's diced up his\Nbounties like an animal bent on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.39,0:00:42.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,carnage. A bloodthirsty beast. He's\Nbeen called nothing less than a living,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.89,0:00:44.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,breathing demon in human form?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.45,0:01:00.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wealth, fame, power.
