Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.53,0:01:16.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.55,0:01:21.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These words lured men to\Nthe Grand Line in pursuit
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.91,0:01:24.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of dreams greater than\Nthey'd ever dared to imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.09,0:01:27.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.09,0:01:32.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.47,0:01:38.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.33,0:01:40.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One Piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.61,0:01:50.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compass left behind,\Nit'll only slow us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.23,0:01:56.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your heart will be your guide,\Nraise the sails and take the helm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.17,0:02:01.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That legendary place that\Nthe end of the map reveals.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.51,0:02:07.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is only legendary till\Nsomeone proves it real?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.85,0:02:12.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through it all, through\Nall the trouble and times.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.17,0:02:14.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through the heartache\Nand through the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.49,0:02:18.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know that I will be there to stand by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.77,0:02:21.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like I know you'll stand by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.83,0:02:25.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So come aboard and bring along.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.93,0:02:28.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.01,0:02:31.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.55,0:02:33.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.75,0:02:37.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's always room for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.37,0:02:40.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you wanna be my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.73,0:02:44.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are, we are on the cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.97,0:02:47.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.89,0:02:54.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're here!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.47,0:02:58.22,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(725,0)\3c&H1E1E1E&\c&H1E1E1E&\bord2.3\1a&HFF&\t(683,725,\1a&H00&)\pos(720,800)}The Pirate King\Nand the Master Swordsman
Dialogue: 2,0:02:54.47,0:02:58.22,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(725,0)\c&HE7E6E6&\bord0\4a&HFF&\pos(720,800)}The Pirate King\Nand the Master Swordsman
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.80,0:02:56.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The marine base city!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.11,0:03:02.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, seriously,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.39,0:03:03.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're out of your mind if you think the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.63,0:03:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right thing to do is get\Nthis guy to join you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.67,0:03:07.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I haven't made up my mind yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.41,0:03:08.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta see if he's a good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.81,0:03:11.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's imprisoned because\Nhe's obviously not!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.55,0:03:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, is that guy Zoro\Naround here somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.43,0:03:27.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we shouldn't mention\Nthe name Zoro here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.29,0:03:30.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's head to the base and check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.33,0:03:32.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to be a marine, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.11,0:03:35.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, of course I do, Luffy, but I\Nreally don't think I'm ready just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.85,0:03:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From what I've heard, the man in charge\Nof this base is named Captain Morgan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.67,0:03:48.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This town is such a weird\Nplace! That was odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.67,0:03:50.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, I understand if\Nthey're scared of Zoro,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.61,0:03:53.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but why did they flip when I\Nmentioned the marine captain's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.61,0:03:54.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.52,0:03:56.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a bad feeling about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.75,0:03:59.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe they were all just jumping\Naround for the fun of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.45,0:04:01.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And how would that make any sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.63,0:04:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This looks like the place!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.43,0:04:06.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.23,0:04:10.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is where you and I part ways, Lou.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.27,0:04:12.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We didn't have long together, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.29,0:04:14.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's the foothold?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.45,0:04:15.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get down from there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.43,0:04:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.34,0:04:17.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.26,0:04:18.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now where's this demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.13,0:04:21.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They wouldn't keep him out in the open.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.09,0:04:23.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's probably tucked in a\Nprison cell below ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.83,0:04:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.81,0:04:26.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.79,0:04:29.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kobe, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.79,0:04:32.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, he's not...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.69,0:04:42.53,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(1482,0)\an8\bord4\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,575)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(1440,1482,\1a&H00&)}"Pirate Hunter" Roronoa Zoro
Dialogue: 3,0:04:35.69,0:04:42.53,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(1482,0)\an8\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,575)\c&HE6E6E6&\4a&HFF&}"Pirate Hunter" Roronoa Zoro
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.65,0:04:39.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That foot on his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.21,0:04:41.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and a Haramaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.37,0:04:44.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Frollo no Masira.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.29,0:04:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we untie those ropes,\Nhe can just walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.15,0:04:51.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't be such an idiot, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.27,0:04:54.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no telling what a bandit\Nlike him will do if you let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.37,0:04:55.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He might just kill us both.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.99,0:04:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'm strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.53,0:04:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can protect us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.44,0:05:00.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's lost his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.79,0:05:01.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.15,0:05:05.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're an eyesore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.17,0:05:09.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.61,0:05:15.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oofy, trust me, there's no chance to\Nsurvive with someone like him on your crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.21,0:05:26.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oofy, we've got to stop her!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.45,0:05:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'll be killed either by the\NMarines or the demon himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.25,0:05:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.16,0:05:34.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you might be getting hungry\Nnow, so I made you a couple of rice balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.97,0:05:37.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got a death wish, kid? Just scram.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.59,0:05:40.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you haven't eaten anything the\Nwhole time you've been tied up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.75,0:05:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.66,0:05:43.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never really made them before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.85,0:05:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I did my best, so\NI think they're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.39,0:05:49.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, kid, I'm not hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.23,0:05:51.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now stop irritating me\Nand get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.57,0:05:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.48,0:05:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not make me kick your ass, little girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.93,0:05:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, now, no one likes a bully.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:58.82,0:06:04.24,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(476,0)\an2\bord4\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,615)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(434,476,\1a&H00&)}Helmeppo\NCaptain Morgan's Son
Dialogue: 3,0:05:58.82,0:06:04.24,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(476,0)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,615)\c&HE6E6E6&\4a&HFF&}Helmeppo\NCaptain Morgan's Son
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.09,0:06:02.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robo Noah Zoro, you seem\Nto be handling this well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.65,0:06:03.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.25,0:06:06.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look, now there's another weird guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.41,0:06:07.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.79,0:06:09.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must be with the Marines.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.53,0:06:11.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we know the girl will be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.97,0:06:14.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lock, some tasty rice balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.99,0:06:16.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.41,0:06:19.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.81,0:06:21.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're packed with sugar!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.23,0:06:23.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to use salt, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.31,0:06:24.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Salt! But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.55,0:06:26.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought they'd taste better sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.77,0:06:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.03,0:06:29.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.99,0:06:31.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I worked so hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.15,0:06:32.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.01,0:06:43.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I worked so hard to\Nmake those too bad you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.87,0:06:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,must have not read the\Nnotice that was posted.
