Dialogue: 1,0:06:51.07,0:06:51.11,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1467.03,1089.58)\org(1579.03,1096.25)\blur0.8\bord0\frx-1.75\fry1.64\frz371.25\fax0.13\fnKnorke\c&H12171E&\b0}MARINE
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.59,0:06:58.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems even little\Nbrats fear my daddy his
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.39,0:07:02.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,daddy so that guy's father\Nis captain morgan. You!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.93,0:07:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Toss this kid out, right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.01,0:07:08.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said, throw her over the wall, soldier!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.95,0:07:13.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, if you won't follow my orders, I'll\Ntell my father. Yes, sir! I'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.91,0:07:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.47,0:07:25.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.45,0:07:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bepo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.36,0:07:28.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you two okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.63,0:07:30.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about you, little girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.15,0:07:30.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.06,0:07:31.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.98,0:07:33.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe how\Nwretched a person he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.59,0:07:34.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now where are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.57,0:07:36.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anywhere? Damn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.87,0:07:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just dead set on staying\Nalive, aren't you? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.87,0:07:47.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm gonna make it to the\Nmonth without any problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.23,0:07:48.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.14,0:07:49.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck with that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.11,0:07:53.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only ten days left!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.97,0:07:57.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you still assume you'll make\Nit to the end of those ten days!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.53,0:08:00.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can that man be so cruel?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.45,0:08:02.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.89,0:08:03.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.80,0:08:04.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.79,0:08:08.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I hear you're a bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.07,0:08:10.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.31,0:08:13.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're stuck out here for all\Nthe world to see and nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.39,0:08:14.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you really all that strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.77,0:08:16.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mind your own business.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.79,0:08:22.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I were you, I'd probably\Nstarve to death in three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.13,0:08:24.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got more spirit\Nthan you could ever have.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.85,0:08:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which is how I'm gonna\Nsurvive this ordeal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.13,0:08:29.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.19,0:08:31.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.10,0:08:31.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a weirdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.17,0:08:33.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.31,0:08:36.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you pick that up for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.89,0:08:39.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna eat this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.87,0:08:41.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because it's mostly a ball of mud.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.11,0:08:43.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up and give it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.21,0:08:44.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.97,0:08:52.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should have listened to me. It was good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.19,0:08:55.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.95,0:08:58.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.77,0:09:00.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.83,0:09:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He ate every last grain of rice there was.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.35,0:09:04.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.73,0:09:09.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Zoro is really as evil as\Neveryone thinks that he is. He's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.27,0:09:14.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's good, because he got\Nhimself punished for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.05,0:09:17.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're, uh, you're making no sense. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.95,0:09:19.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's that dumb Helmeppo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.69,0:09:22.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the son of Captain Morgan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.27,0:09:26.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Step aside! Step aside!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.47,0:09:28.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make way for my beautiful pet doggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.01,0:09:31.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone who doesn't move,\NI'll have executed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.49,0:09:41.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it! You mean nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.55,0:09:42.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You, little girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.79,0:09:46.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there some kind of problem with\Nhow my beloved dog is behaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.31,0:09:47.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rick, put it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.65,0:09:49.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't want to get us in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.57,0:09:55.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,AHHHHH! OOH!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.61,0:09:59.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He dies so down!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.29,0:10:05.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Elmepo keeps punching and\Nkicking him while he's tied up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.43,0:10:06.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's being so unfair!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.17,0:10:08.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.19,0:10:10.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to help him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.25,0:10:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see why you're upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.61,0:10:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.67,0:10:19.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring us whatever you got and\Nkeep the check for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.13,0:10:22.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And bring me a bottle of your finest\Nmoonshine or whatever crap you serve.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.67,0:10:24.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to think of\Nsomething interesting to
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.71,0:10:27.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do seeing as how I'm bored\Nout of my skull here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.23,0:10:29.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose I could execute Zoro
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.69,0:10:41.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just hit me! Luffy, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.29,0:10:42.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't hit him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.39,0:10:43.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy is scum!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.93,0:10:45.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You actually hit me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.09,0:10:48.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Captain Morgan's son, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.65,0:10:49.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, like I care!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.93,0:10:52.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll care after he\Nexecutes you for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.91,0:10:54.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just be a man and fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.05,0:10:56.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mubi, just ease off some!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.69,0:10:58.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you trying to get\Non the Marine's bad side?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.91,0:11:00.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It made up my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.05,0:11:04.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today, Zoro joins my crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.31,0:11:12.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am... great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.67,0:11:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.58,0:11:14.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, Captain Morgan, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.91,0:11:20.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet the taxes we collect don't even\Ncompare to my sheer degree of greatness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.45,0:11:21.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, right, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.51,0:11:24.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess that the citizens' wallets\Njust aren't very deep these days, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.93,0:11:28.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The issue at hand here is\Nthe level of respect for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.09,0:11:30.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you agree...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.29,0:11:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.57,0:11:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's someone outside that I want you\Nto slaughter, and I want it done now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.21,0:11:47.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You again? Don't you have things\Nto do? I'll untie you, but only.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.21,0:11:50.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you promise to join my crew\Nyou're what i run a pirate crew
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.05,0:11:55.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and i'm looking for people to\Njoin up no way i never stooped to
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.47,0:11:59.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,joining up with a criminal screw\Nthat business and what's wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.17,0:12:02.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with being a pirate they're\Ndespicable like i never want to join
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.61,0:12:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,up with one oh come on give me\Na break everyone already knows
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.69,0:12:08.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you as some vicious bounty hunter\Nalways out for blood people
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.77,0:12:12.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can say whatever they want about\Nme but i've never done a single
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.09,0:12:15.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thing in my life that i regret\Ni will make it through this
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.99,0:12:21.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,challenge and after that i'll\Naccomplish what i want yeah that's
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.37,0:12:24.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,great but i've already decided\Nthat you're going to be on my crew
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.81,0:12:27.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what you can't do that i hear\Nyou're one of the best swordsmen
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.85,0:12:31.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,around well i am but that idiot\Ncaptain's son took mine away
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.77,0:12:35.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,guess i'll just have to go get it\Nback for you what so if you want
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.69,0:12:38.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your sword you're just gonna\Nhave to join my crew now you're
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.37,0:12:43.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,really pissing me off wait he's\Nactually gonna bust in there alone
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.31,0:12:56.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's it stop right there now stand it up
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.59,0:13:00.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in one final pull well\Ndad are you gonna get
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.55,0:13:02.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,revenge on this guy or what i mean he just
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.83,0:13:05.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,outright struck me in\Npublic you've never hit me
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.75,0:13:08.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,before why should he\Nbe able to do you have
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.35,0:13:12.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,any remote ideas to why\Ni've never hit you well
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.05,0:13:19.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is it because you think\Ni'm great no it's because
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.31,0:13:26.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're
Dialogue: 1,0:13:26.26,0:13:31.64,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(476,0)\an2\bord4\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,615)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(434,476,\1a&H00&)}"Axe-Hand" Morgan\NMarine Captain
Dialogue: 3,0:13:26.26,0:13:31.64,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(476,0)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,615)\c&HE6E6E6&\4a&HFF&}"Axe-Hand" Morgan\NMarine Captain
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.25,0:13:28.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.16,0:13:28.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stupid fool
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.08,0:13:30.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who isn't even worth it
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.51,0:13:34.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want you to get the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.47,0:13:41.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only great one around here\Nis the man you call your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.21,0:13:48.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which reminds me, I heard a rat\Nsnuck into the crucifixion yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.03,0:13:53.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right, the little\Ngirl, but I had her dealt with.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.37,0:13:54.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope that means killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.99,0:13:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't kill her, she's just a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.73,0:14:02.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You there, go into town,\Nfind this girl and kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.57,0:14:05.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, sir, you can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.27,0:14:07.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's just a little girl, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.15,0:14:09.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care if she's a child or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.11,0:14:11.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone who disobeys my\Norders is a traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.89,0:14:14.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, sir, I can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.69,0:14:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.59,0:14:23.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You, you killed him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.73,0:14:27.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My strength was what I used\Nto rise to the rank of captain
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.59,0:14:31.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, in this world,\Ntitles are what matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.59,0:14:36.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means by being the captain of this\Nbase and the highest ranking officer,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.67,0:14:40.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the most superior person\Nas far as the eye can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.29,0:14:44.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This means that I do everything right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.97,0:14:47.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I correct, men?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.91,0:14:49.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, you are correct, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.87,0:14:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's put killing the\Ngirl on hold for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.93,0:14:56.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Observe, the greatest symbol\Nof my unending authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.37,0:14:59.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It took years to complete, but here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.11,0:15:01.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now stand it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.41,0:15:06.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Display my greatness at the top\Nof this base for all to see!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.51,0:15:10.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.75,0:15:11.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nobody here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.29,0:15:16.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta find that crazy idiot's son\Nand get Zoro's sword back for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.55,0:15:18.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pullman, harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.09,0:15:25.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.63,0:15:30.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bumped it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.37,0:15:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like something's going on up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.91,0:15:38.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, sir. I was\Nreckless. I didn't mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.23,0:15:40.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I consider the slightest scratch on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.85,0:15:46.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing less than a traitorous\Nactivity that's punishable by death.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.59,0:15:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I should check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.07,0:15:52.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jump, jump, rocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.39,0:15:53.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.27,0:15:56.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I took too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.45,0:15:58.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.05,0:16:01.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It flew up from the ground! Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.71,0:16:14.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.83,0:16:22.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seize him and hold him so I can kill\Nhim myself! Sir! Right away! That's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.93,0:16:23.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.84,0:16:25.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the one who pushed me, Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.53,0:16:26.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.03,0:16:29.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been looking for\Nyou all over the place!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.19,0:16:31.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have something that I\Nreally need to get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.55,0:16:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.46,0:16:33.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help that man!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.39,0:16:35.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not let that man escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.69,0:16:38.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain, there's someone\Nin the crucifixion yard!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.27,0:16:39.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.93,0:16:47.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm surrounded by traitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.61,0:16:49.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to get out of here, Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.67,0:16:52.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That maniac's gonna kill you\Nfor what you're doing right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.59,0:16:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stand to watch the\Nmarines behave like this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.65,0:16:58.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A true marine should be honorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.43,0:17:01.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, kid, I can't leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.15,0:17:02.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got ten days left.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.71,0:17:03.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then they're...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.62,0:17:04.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.54,0:17:05.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're gonna execute you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.71,0:17:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.62,0:17:08.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,El Meppo never intended\Nto honor your agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.07,0:17:11.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He planned on killing you from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.15,0:17:13.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which made Luffy really angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.37,0:17:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we just knocked him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.05,0:17:16.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.99,0:17:20.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that the marines are mad,\Nthey're dead set on catching Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.91,0:17:23.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'm not going to ask\Nyou to become a pirate, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.03,0:17:25.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I hope you'll help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.75,0:17:28.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have a lot of strength you can offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.67,0:17:35.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy's the only person here who can\Nactually save you from execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.01,0:17:42.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And, of course, you're the only one here\Nwho can save him from a very similar fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.95,0:17:46.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,End of the line!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.01,0:17:52.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, so tell me where Zoro's sword is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.19,0:17:53.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.55,0:17:56.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just please stop dragging\Nme across the carpet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.31,0:17:57.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, which way?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.37,0:17:59.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In my room, we just passed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.39,0:18:00.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behind you on the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.67,0:18:02.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you say so earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.51,0:18:04.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, we gotta go all the way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.37,0:18:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.28,0:18:07.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Except for letting Helmeppo go. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.89,0:18:12.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can try shooting me if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.45,0:18:14.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, please don't shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.33,0:18:15.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get the hell out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.83,0:18:21.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the crime of treason against me, I\Nsentence you both to die where you stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.65,0:18:26.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This looks like yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.73,0:18:30.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.75,0:18:33.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, there are three here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.93,0:18:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey weirdo, which one of these is Serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.57,0:18:38.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see he passed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.39,0:18:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kobe!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.51,0:18:51.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been pulling some\Ninteresting moves around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.73,0:18:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.69,0:18:55.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some kind of poorly executed coup?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.55,0:18:57.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two planned with the Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.89,0:19:00.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always fought alone\Nlike a real man does,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.83,0:19:05.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not like a coward who hides behind\Nhis wall of expendable cronies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.19,0:19:09.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roronoa Saru, don't you\Ndare underestimate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.61,0:19:13.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may be a strong fighter,\NBut under my authority,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.31,0:19:16.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're just a rat we throw\Nout with the trash. Take aim!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.39,0:19:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.01,0:19:23.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't afford to die here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.65,0:19:29.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Match over!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.39,0:19:34.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the winner, Conney, with\N2,000 total wins and zero losses.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.51,0:19:36.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.89,0:19:38.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're weak, Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.53,0:19:39.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing ever changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.37,0:19:43.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, for a boy, you're pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.75,0:19:45.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Zoro isn't weak at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.67,0:19:48.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's one of the strongest\Nout of all the guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.17,0:19:49.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's even beaten grown-ups.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.77,0:19:52.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he's nowhere as strong as me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.93,0:19:55.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even with two swords, a\Nweakling is still a weakling.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.05,0:19:58.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You losers would do good to\Nremember that and keep quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.99,0:20:02.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your howling makes you look even\Nmore pitiful than you already are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.93,0:20:12.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've grown so strong, Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.37,0:20:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet, you continue to lose\Nevery match against Kuina.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.21,0:20:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.12,0:20:19.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you getting her special training?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.03,0:20:22.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She might be her daughter,\Nbut that's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.65,0:20:23.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't cheat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.89,0:20:24.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.87,0:20:26.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've done nothing of the sort.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.05,0:20:29.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, Zoro has grown stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.05,0:20:33.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Kuina has continued\Nto grow stronger as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.51,0:20:35.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro! Zoro?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.25,0:20:37.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go clean up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.69,0:20:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.79,0:20:49.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can't I beat Clan? Why? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.75,0:20:54.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be the strongest swordsman\Nin the world, so why can't I beat her?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.63,0:21:08.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thorough, it's laid\Nout. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.13,0:21:11.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Funny, I was gonna ask\Nyou the same question.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.13,0:21:13.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing out so late?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.97,0:21:19.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've come here to challenge\Nyou to your City fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.65,0:21:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's gonna be the last\Nfight you and me will ever have.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.29,0:21:24.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ends tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.99,0:21:26.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fight me with a real sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.17,0:21:28.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do have one, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.61,0:21:32.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Real swords?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.89,0:21:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.63,0:22:01.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.43,0:22:06.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.65,0:22:16.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Win, number 2001.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.85,0:22:24.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.97,0:22:28.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.09,0:22:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who should be crying\Nout of frustration, not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.23,0:22:40.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When girls grow up,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.95,0:22:45.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's natural for us to develop into\Nphysically weaker beings than men.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.17,0:22:48.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even you will catch up to me soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.05,0:22:54.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always heard you say to me, you're\Ngoing to be the world's greatest swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.05,0:23:00.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I told my father the same\Nthing, he said I could never be that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.61,0:23:06.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I know, I know that, but\Nit's just so frustrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.15,0:23:13.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're lucky, Zoro, being born as a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.85,0:23:16.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I ever wanted was to be\Nthe world's greatest swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.75,0:23:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My breasts have even\Nstarted to grow out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.71,0:23:20.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.99,0:23:23.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if I'd just been born a man!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.13,0:23:28.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't fly off in the mouth whining\Nlike that after you beat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.77,0:23:30.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because it's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.43,0:23:32.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're my goal. You know\Nhow this makes me feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.89,0:23:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.80,0:23:34.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy this, girl that,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.11,0:23:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are you going to keep up that same\Nkind of talk after I beat you someday?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.75,0:23:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like skill is irrelevant!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.65,0:23:44.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just an insult to all of the\Ntraining I've been pouring on every day!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.89,0:23:46.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So don't say that crap, would ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.23,0:23:50.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now promise me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.41,0:23:55.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Promise me that someday one of us will\Nbe the world's greatest swordsman!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.41,0:23:57.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll compete and see who gets there!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.95,0:24:03.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dummy, you're so weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.61,0:24:08.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.73,0:24:16.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta get stronger so I\Ncan hold lots of swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.05,0:24:19.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two's not enough, I'll use three!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.39,0:24:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you guys want?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.43,0:24:30.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuina.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.07,0:24:33.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuina is dead, Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.07,0:24:49.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They said she slipped and fell\Ndown the storehouse steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.97,0:24:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Storehouse?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.91,0:24:54.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looking for a sharpening\Nstone for her beloved sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.15,0:24:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What would she need that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.85,0:24:56.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.17,0:24:58.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was just a child, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.23,0:25:01.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knows why anyone does anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.47,0:25:03.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way to rationalize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.15,0:25:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess you never know what's waiting\Nfor you around the next corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.85,0:25:19.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It may appear otherwise to the blind\Neye, But people are quite fragile things.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.81,0:25:34.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sensei...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.51,0:25:39.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I ask that you let me have that sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.31,0:25:42.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kawina's sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.17,0:25:45.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.79,0:25:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stronger than she ever was, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.37,0:25:51.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strong enough that my name\Nreaches up to the heavens!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.17,0:25:59.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am going to be the\Nworld's greatest swordsman!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.09,0:26:00.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promised her!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.65,0:26:01.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promised!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.89,0:26:02.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.91,0:26:11.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sword is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.29,0:26:21.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I leave her spirit and\Nher dreams in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.51,0:26:50.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gum, gum, rocket! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.75,0:26:57.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Wolf, no! Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.61,0:27:03.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.03,0:27:10.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That won't work on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.87,0:27:12.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Told you I was strong! What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.43,0:27:14.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.75,0:27:17.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name's Monkey D.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.59,0:27:20.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, and I'm gonna\Nbe king of the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.81,0:27:35.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a kid, I never stopped\Nsearching for a great treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.77,0:27:40.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a map in my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.67,0:27:43.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That I knew would lead me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.33,0:27:47.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to find my way to that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.51,0:27:50.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before someone could beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.45,0:27:54.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The promised land was in my grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.59,0:27:57.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I wouldn't let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.27,0:28:00.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La la la la.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.03,0:28:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My only dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.39,0:28:04.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La la la la la.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.59,0:28:10.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't stop chasing\Nit until it comes true.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.23,0:28:18.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the world ever changes\Nas I call out your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.89,0:28:25.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We return to the time when\Neverything's the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.21,0:28:32.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I'm with you,\Nmy memories won't fade.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.27,0:28:37.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waiting for that one true dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.87,0:28:39.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be back.

